asers, Gauss)<br></li><li> class-specific abilities<br></li><li> 3 different maps, each with unique play style<br></li><li> infinite number of possible ship designs thanks to vast building options and mirror mode<br></li><li> high level of replayability <br></li><li> player profiles and top ladders<br></li><li> skill-based matchmaking with players from all around the world!</li></ul><br>New with the full release (compared to Early Access):<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> brand new game mode: Galactic Conquest<br></li><li> reworked game mechanics and abilities<br></li><li> class system overhaul<br></li><li> Tactical Communication Interface<br></li><li> revamped game start<br></li><li> AI opponents<br></li><li> sales and new DLCs</li></ul>","developers":["Pixel Federation"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562590/header.jpg?t=1546622319","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.6 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB or higher<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st